{"id":"44829a217799408a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCtxLift.md","title":"PolyCtxLift","display":"PolyCtxLift","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyCtxLift","parameters":["g","h"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyCtxLift"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>h</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 语法。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>h</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyCtxLift g h)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists n\n  (exists z\n    (exists one\n      (and\n        (@ Seq g n)\n        (and\n          (@ Seq h n)\n          (and\n            (@ Num0 z)\n            (and\n              (@ Num1 one)\n              (forall i\n                (implies (in i n) (exists a (exists b (and (@ App g i a) (and (@ App h i b) (@ FTyShift z one a b))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c2fe7abb9b79960a\" href=\"?note=c2fe7abb9b79960a\" title=\"ZFC_FTyShift\">FTyShift</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyCtxLift g h)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShift|FTyShift]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTyShift","status":"resolved","id":"c2fe7abb9b79960a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShift|FTyShift]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num0","status":"resolved","id":"e8cec2782b4668b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShift|FTyShift]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num1","status":"resolved","id":"6abf464803506304","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShift|FTyShift]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Seq","status":"resolved","id":"ae1f2bbcc1dff983","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShift|FTyShift]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_Z